    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Podho pa Yeriko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo oyido ocegi waŋkace ma Yeriko gi woko kwoŋbedo Joisiraili; ongoye ŋat'owok kendo ongoye ŋat'odonjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Rwoth waco ri Yosuwa ni, “Neni, atieko ketho Yeriko i cingin, gi kere kodi cwo mere matek ma jomeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibino ŋanjo thoko tindi madwoŋ, cwo je ma jolweny wikidhi withok tindi madwoŋ dicel. Wilatimo ameno ma ndelo aucel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka jocway ri Were i wi migam abirio jolatiŋo gwarin abirio ma tungi wot rombo ruwaŋ kakan; aka i ndelo mar'abirio wibino ŋanjo thoko tindi madwoŋ dibirio, kareno jocway ri Were i wi migam jokudho gwarin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ka jotimo derino madwoŋ gi tungi wot rombo, tekin wiwinjo derino ma gwarin, nyaka to ji je jokoko gi woy madwoŋ; aka kor ot ma tindi madwoŋ lagore piny kicutho, aka ji jolakidho kisi dhano tirtir gine.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Yosuwa wod pa Nun olwoŋo jocway ri Were i wi migam to waco rijo ni, “Kwany win Kakan ma Cikirok, aka weyi jocway ri Were i wi migam abirio jowotiŋ gwarin abirio ma tungi wot rombo ruwaŋ Kakan ma Cikirok pa Rwoth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Yosuwa waco ri ji ni, “Tel win; ŋanji win withoki tindi madwoŋ, aka wiwey cwo ma jotiŋo gilweny jowoluwi ruwaŋ Kakan ma Cikirok pa Rwoth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka paka oyido Yosuwa otieko oro ji, jocway ri Were i wi migam abirio ma jotiŋo gwarin abirio ma tungi wot rombo ruwaŋ Rwoth to jokidho yumalo, kareno jokudho gwarin, gi Kakan ma Cikirok pa Rwoth m'oyido luwo jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To cwo ma jotiŋo gilweny jotelo jocway ri Were i wi migam ma jokudho gwarin, aka jokur ma yucen joluwo Kakan ma Cikirok, kareno gwarin ywak m'ongoye liŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Yosuwa wodho or ri ji ni, “Wikiri wikoki kosa wimiy dwondi win wowinjere, aka wac moro je wokiri wowoki i dhok win, cuka ndelo m'anoor win koko; nyaka to wikoko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno go omiyo Kakan ma Cikirok pa Rwoth woth thoko tindi madwoŋ, woth thoko dicel, to jotundo i kambi, to jonindo i kambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Yosuwa ocew odikin maŋic, to jocway ri Were i wi migam jokwanyo Kakan ma Cikirok pa Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jocway ri Were i wi migam abirio ma jotiŋo gwarin abirio ma tungi wod rombo ruwaŋ Kakan ma Cikirok pa Rwoth jokadho, kareno jokudho gwarin m'ongoye liŋ; aka cwo ma jotiŋo gilweny jotelo jo, to jokur ma yucen joluwo Kakan ma Cikirok pa Rwoth, kareno ikudho gwarin m'ongoye liŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka i ndelo mar'ario joŋanjo thoko tindi madwoŋ dicel, to jogik i kambi. Ameno apaka jotimo ma ndelo aucel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo mar'abirio munyo jocewi odikin maŋic ma nyaka ŋamba cot, to joŋanjo thoko tindi madwoŋ i nger acel won dibirio. Oyido obedo i ndelo no won kende ma joŋanj'iye thoko tindi madwoŋ dibirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ma dibirio, munyo jocway ri Were i wi migam jotieko kudho gwarin, Yosuwa owaco ri ji ni, “Koki win, rupiri Rwoth otieko miyo win tindi madwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka tindi madwoŋ kodi gimoro je manitie i iye ilamiyo Rwoth mar'areya; kende Rahab m'obedo malaya kodi ji manitie gi go i ot ama wowey jo, rupiri go okano jopendo ma waoro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To win, gwokere win kwoŋ gigipiny m'omiy mar'areya, kosa ka witieko miyo jo wikwanyo gimoro je kwoŋ gigipiny m'omiy to witimo kambi ma Isiraili gimoro mar'areya, to wikelo teko kwoŋe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To feza je gi zahabu, kodi gigipiny ma ywel kodi nyweny, jobedo maleŋ ri Rwoth; jolakidho i od pesa pa Rwoth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebu 11:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno ji jokoko, t'ikudho gwarin. Tekin ji jowinjo derino ma gwarin to ji jokoko malo swa, to kor ot gore piny kicutho, ameno ji jodonjo i tindi madwoŋ, kisi dhano tirtir ruwaŋ go to jomako tindi madwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo joreyo woko kicutho kisi gimoro je ma tindi madwoŋ cwo gi mon, jomathindho kodi jom'oti, megikwe, rombo, gi punde, gi lew abor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosuwa to waco ri cwo ario m'oyido jokadho dwaro nyaliŋliŋ ma piny ni, “Kidhi win i ot pa malaya, aka wiwodhi go, kodi jono je ma jobedo apere, paka wikwoŋere rigo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno to cwo m'oyido jobedo jopendo jodonjo, to jowodho Rahab gi bamere gi min gi wutmin kodi jono je ma jobedo apere; to jokelo wade pere je, to jojengo jo woko ma kambi ma Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jowaŋo tindi madwoŋ gi mac, kodi gimoro je manitie i iye; kwanyowoko feza gi zahabu, gi gigipiny ma ywel kodi nyweny, joketho i od pesa ma Ot pa Rwoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ebu 11:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Rahab m'obedo malaya, kodi ji ma ot pa bamere, kodi jono je ma jobedo apere, Yosuwa obotho jo makwo; aka go obedo i Isiraili kiri gunyo ni, rupiri go okano jopendo ma Yosuwa ooro timo nyaliŋliŋ i Yeriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
